uot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;:-)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;LAVA&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7947900232607813907'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7947900232607813907'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1370639409798#c7947900232607813907' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-591626764"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 7, 2013 at 3:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7835614040812803875</id><published>2013-05-16T09:57:47.053-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-16T09:57:47.053-06:00</updated><title type='text'>History repeats;&#xa;“An appeal to Arms and the God of...</title><content type='html'>History repeats;&lt;br /&gt;“An appeal to Arms and the God of Hosts is all that is left us.” Patrick Henry&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7835614040812803875'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7835614040812803875'/><link rel='alte