humbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2087141373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 8, 2013 at 6:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7719286931763268989</id><published>2013-05-06T23:45:19.824-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-06T23:45:19.824-06:00</updated><title type='text'>MissAnthropy said...&amp;quot; I used to be one of tho...</title><content type='html'>MissAnthropy said...&amp;quot; I used to be one of those types of conservatives, believing all that stuff about Officer Friendly there to help elderly widows cross the street and stopping genuinely bad guys, etc. &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I wonder what enlightened you?&lt;br /&gt;I wonder if it can be replicated or bottled?&lt;br /&gt;I imagine such can only be learned the hard way if one hasn&amp;#39;t learned by now.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7719286931763268989'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/7719286931763268989'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1367905519824#c7719286931763268989' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-727277234"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 6, 2013 at 11:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-697175399473212984</id><published>2013-05-06T17:00:15.640-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-06T17:00:15.640-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Will,&#xa;&#xa;I am so glad to see you back in action...</title><content type='html'>Dear Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I am so glad to see you back in action!  You were sorely missed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s interesting how certain State crimes escalate based on the condition of the economy.  Bradshaw is merely one of many cogs making up an alarming barometer measuring when the government will finally, officially and with brute force systematically murder its population.  All under the pretense of keeping the ones they don&amp;#39;t murder, maim, rape, torture and kidnap &amp;#39;safe&amp;#39;.  The fact that violence and force have become a plausible alternative to civility to these people should clearly point the tin-foiled, padded glove finger at the esteemed Sheriff and anyone idiotic and bloodthirsty enough to follow his orders.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;G-d Bless you, Will and I&amp;#39;m so glad you&amp;#39;re getting better.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sincerely,&lt;br /&gt;Julie&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/697175399473212984'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/697175399473212984'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1367881215640#c697175399473212984' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-777914246"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 6, 2013 at 5:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4611743192553990068</id><published>2013-05-06T16:10:10.642-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-06T16:10:10.642-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sheriff Bradshaw, if you get around to reading thi...</title><content type='html'>Sheriff Bradshaw, if you get around to reading this, a statement and a question.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;First: FUCK YOU and your entire Nazi department.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Second: When do you intend to take Rush Gasbaugh into custody and/or refer him to services?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/4611743192553990068'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/4611743192553990068'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1367878210642#c4611743192553990068' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-432419624"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 6, 2013 at 4:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3238976877794924664</id><published>2013-05-06T12:03:27.135-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-06T12:03:27.135-06:00</updated><title type='text'>People always assume that the police only do these...</title><content type='html'>People always assume that the police only do these things to &amp;quot;bad people&amp;quot; who fit the stereotype of whatever group they don&amp;#39;t like ie: racial minorities, right wing extremists etc.  The L &amp;amp; O Republicans are getting scared now because of the current occupant of the White House. When Bush III gets in office it will be the other side&amp;#39;s turn for outrage. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Learning</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/3238976877794924664'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/3238976877794924664'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1367863407135#c3238976877794924664' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-845839703"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 6, 2013 at 12:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2992388266011568866</id><published>2013-05-06T08:11:14.348-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-06T08:11:14.348-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m so glad we left Palm Beach County. We now ...</title><content type='html'>I&amp;#39;m so glad we left Palm Beach County. We now live in a County with an American Sheriff.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/2992388266011568866'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7739860764568085296/comments/default/2992388266011568866'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html?showComment=1367849474348#c2992388266011568866' title=''/><author><name>REWPAW</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/05/sheriff-bradshaw-and-palm-beach-county.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7739860764568085296' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7739860764568085296' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1304842962"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger